{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d471","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07a5e-8204-7c61-b778-7e703c0d991a"},"sequence":2195,"recorded_at":1780531400004385,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2a014316-3376-47a3-a185-8cb71122e6e6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"2a014316-3376-47a3-a185-8cb71122e6e6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2a014316-3376-47a3-a185-8cb71122e6e6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"ff6a3866-b571-4ce3-a750-0119e1d5c4f8"},"task_id":"ff6a3866-b571-4ce3-a750-0119e1d5c4f8","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"ff6a3866-b571-4ce3-a750-0119e1d5c4f8","chunk":"Read text file `LOGBOOK.md`.\n1|# Flight Logbook\n2|\n3|> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n4|> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n5|\n6|## 2026-09-07\n7|\n8|### 0945 — 2okwyf round 2: F1 sibling echo closed at CheckVersionTuple, ParseID comment corrected, 31/31 census\n9|- SCOPE: TASK-260906-2okwyf rework (review rev3 CHANGES REQUESTED, one blocking F1). Production: `terminalbackend.go` only — `CheckVersionTuple` validates `backendID` through `ParseID` before any version arm runs (same pattern as `RequireRestoreBinding`/`CheckProviderDescriptor`); `ParseID` comment rewritten from the false \"like every other BackendID in the package\" to the verifiable per-site invariant (mustParseID at Registration/TrustEntry validate; ParseID at Resolve/RequireRestoreBinding/CheckVersionTuple/CheckProviderDescriptor entries and Manifest/Probe/Evidence admission; constants + validated records at New/RegisterExternal). Test: new `TestCheckVersionTupleRefusesHostileBackendIDWithoutEcho` (3 arms x 2 hostile shapes + valid-ID and ax.evil controls).\n10|- FINDING (F1 confirmed pre-fix): hostile `200xA + ESC[31m + ../../etc/passwd` through production `CheckVersionTuple` rendered a 322-byte refusal containing the whole string at all three arms (BackendID echo + Error() render). Red-before: new test 6/6 FAIL; post-fix 7/7 PASS (exit 0).\n(more lines below)"}}}
