ly + 43 free with reasons). `ParseID` comment rewritten to state what the instrument enforces, nothing beyond.\n+- FINDING (F2 confirmed pre-fix): hostile structs through production `Reconcile` rendered 305B (`executable substitution`) and 313B (`probe generation binding`) refusals containing the whole string. Red-before: new census `reconcile` battery FAILs (both shapes, both arms); post-fix 41/41 PASS. C1 (ParseID guard out of CheckProviderDescriptor) fails closed on exactly the new test (308B echo) while the rest of the package suite stays green — reproducing the reviewer's plant and proving the instrument, not the old suite, holds the class.\n+- FINDING (shadowed pair): CheckProviderDescriptor's digest-parse arm is unreachable via AdmitProviderDescriptor (ParseProviderDescriptor's own digest arm fires first) — carried as an executed exempt pair with a shadow pin, not a 42nd pair. Registration.validate's digest-null arm stays the single site exemption (white-box pin executed in-file).\n+- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260906-2okwyf_outcome-r3.md` + `TASK-260906-2okwyf_battery-r3.json` + `TASK-260906-2okwyf_mutants-r3.json` (6 applied/6 killed/0 survived: narrowing 1 N-tb-reconcile-lengthgated with len27-fail/len221-pass split, arm-deletion 2 D-tb-reconcile-entry + D-tb-checkdesc-entry(C1), ordering 1 R-tb-checktuple-order [N2: correctly refiled from narrowing], census-only 1 C-tb-reconcile-deadarm, audit-only 1 S-tb-statusresult-shadow killed only by the full-run audit naming conformance.go:765; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct control rows; masks non-empty; bodies in JSON). N1: anchors re-derived on the final tree (Reconcile guards manifest.go:1696/1699, sites :1741/:1777/:2099/:2102; descriptor guard terminalbackend.go:646; ParseID census note :163). Candidate tree OID in the outcome doc, computed AFTER the LOGBOOK append, verified by `ls-tree`.\n+- GATES: `go test ./...` exit 0 (23 ok, 0 FAIL), `-race` terminalbackend exit 0, `-cover` exit 0 (tb 95.4%, ph 86.0%, pv 97.8%), `go vet ./...` exit 0, `go build` + `GOOS=windows go build` exit 0, gofmt clean.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/integration are orchestrator steps).\n+\n+### 0945 — 2okwyf round 2: F1 sibling echo closed at CheckVersionTuple, ParseID comment corrected, 31/31 census\n"}}}
